cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Emotionally Adaptive Chatbot for Cyberbullying Support"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first emotional support agent for teenage cyberbullying victims,
  running entirely on local Small Language Models. Combines a fine-tuned emotion
  classifier, a deterministic multi-level crisis detector, turn-by-turn emotional
  memory and emotion-routed clinical RAG. Final Degree Project (TFG), B.Sc. in
  Data Science and Engineering, University of Murcia.
type: software
